    🔥🔥But remember the golden rules of performance optimization:
    • don’t
    • don’t… yet
    • profile before optimizing.

    As a famous computer scientist said:
    PREMATURE OPTIMIZATION IS THE ROOT OF ALL EVIL. — Donald Knuth


- 🔥🔥So strive to make the code as simple and correct and readable as possible, and only start
    thinking about profiling, then optimizing, if you have a proven performance problem.


